C-064 把时钟文件依次写为 selected_at+lease_ttl_s+i*timeout_s-1 [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/interfaces.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":1,"content":"【1 ModelRequest v1】CLI：cliworker models select --request-file <f>，或 --level Top --count 2 --usage Heavy --importance high --cwd <p> --request-id r-001；HTTP：POST /cliworker/select。{schema:'cliworker.request/v1', request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', count:2, usage:'Heavy', importance:'normal', require_readonly:true, cwd:'C:/work/repo', timeout_ms:1800000, exclude_handles:['h_1a2b']}。规则：level 必填，取 Top/High/Middle/Quick，大小写不敏感，缺失返回 E_LEVEL_REQUIRED，非法返回 E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN；count 取 1..10，默认 1；usage 取 Heavy/Normal/Light，默认 Normal；importance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'He [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":3,"totalMatchedLines":3,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false,"headLimitApplied":30}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-c5a9e911-b605-47a6-b462-0d19af8ec7de-19\nfc_fa903d56-4b0c-97c5-88c9-ac6ed4db1bec_1","startedAtMs":"1794076166940","completedAtMs":"1794076167184"},"model_call_id":"1419d7b9-b2c5-497f-97fb-46031fc7648b-5-8aiv","session_id":"c184d3d4-8afd-4ca2-8bcf-45797c342546","timestamp_ms":1794076176385}
