{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-d12fb2c9-fa7d-4224-a598-715de92ca1b8-31\nfc_58ec9eee-27a5-9c45-8fcc-a91a999a2ad4_2","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"\"T-005\"|AC-012|resolvePaths|state_dir","path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json","outputMode":"content","caseInsensitive":false,"headLimit":20,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-d12fb2c9-fa7d-4224-a598-715de92ca1b8-31\nfc_58ec9eee-27a5-9c45-8fcc-a91a999a2ad4_2","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"\"T-005\"|AC-012|resolvePaths|state_dir","path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/005":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":106,"content":"      \"id\": \"AC-012\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":107,"content":"      \"text\": \"resolvePaths 规则按 interfaces 第 11 节。cliworker paths --config X 与 createPlugin 使用 configPath X 时，报告完全相同的 config 绝对路径和 state_dir；两份不同的配置得到不相交的 state_dir；usage 写到该 state_dir；存在旧的 ~/.cliworker/usage.jsonl 时，doctor 给出 W_LEGACY_USAGE。defects/a4-paths 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":242,"content":"      \"text\": \"leak-scan 的 canary 测试：把哨兵分别放进 stdout、stderr、state_dir 下深层文件、audit、HTTP 响应体、子进程 argv，每处都被检出并报告位置；干净运行 0 命中。flows 测试自动发现 test/flows/steps/*.mjs，在同一个临时 state_dir 中用 env 提供哨兵，依次运行全部已有步骤。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":257,"content":"      \"text\": \"配置中键名匹配 token、api_key、secret、password（不区分大小写）且值为字符串而非 SecretRef 时返回 E_CONFIG_SECRET_INLINE。注入的 exec 让 secret-tool、security、pwsh 返回 ENOENT 时，对应后端返回 E_SECRET_BACKEND，state_dir 文件列表不变。auth status 只输出 set 或 unset。三个平台后端的命令构造为纯单测（baseline linux）；原生后端用例按平台门控，只作附加。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":454,"content":