{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-47886bcf-4a15-452f-a12b-e6f459431095-39\nfc_ed8e0367-ae10-9fde-9ce6-5d4035a04749_0","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-Agentline/orchestrator/lib/build.mjs","offset":637,"limit":40},"result":{"success":{"content":"function commandProved(row) {\n  if (!isObject(row) || row.passed !== true) return false\n  const id = typeof row.id === 'string' ? row.id.trim() : ''\n  if (!id || row.exitCode !== 0) return false\n  const marker = `${id} OK`\n  if (typeof row.lastLine !== 'string' || row.lastLine.trim() !== marker) return false\n  if (typeof row.output === 'string') {\n    const lines = row.output.split(/\\r?\\n/).map((line) => line.trim()).filter(Boolean)\n    if (!lines.length || lines[lines.length - 1] !== marker) return false\n  }\n  return true\n}\n\n/** 最近一次改动产品文件的提交时间。.collab 里的审计、评审和 PR 状态不算。 */\nfunction productCommitMs(repo) {\n  try {\n    const out = execFileSync(\n      'git',\n      ['log', '-1', '--format=%ct', 'HEAD', '--', '.', ':(exclude).collab'],\n      { cwd: repo, encoding: 'utf8', stdio: ['ignore', 'pipe', 'ignore'] },\n    ).trim()\n    if (!out) return null\n    const sec = Number(out)\n    return Number.isFinite(sec) ? sec * 1000 : null\n  } catch {\n    return null\n  }\n}\n\nfunction gitPaths(repo, args) {\n  const out = gitText(repo, args)\n  if (out == null) return null\n  return out.split('\\0').map((name) => name.trim()).filter(Boolean)\n}\n\nfunction isProductPath(name) {\n  const file = name.replaceAll('\\\\', '/')\n  return file !== '.collab' && !file.startsWith('.collab/')\n}\n","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":1057,"fileSize":46010,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-Agentline/orchestrator/lib/build.mjs","readRange":{"startLine":637,"endLine":676},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-47886bcf-4a15-452f-a12b-e6f459431095-39\nfc_ed8e0367-ae10-9fde-9ce6-5d4035a04749_0","startedAtMs":"1794076220012","completedAtMs":"1794076220174"},"model_call_id":"1419d7b9-b2c5-497f-97fb-46031fc7648b-14-14mx","session_id":"c184d3d4-8afd-4ca2-8bcf-45797c342546","timestamp_ms":1794076220318}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-47886bcf-4a15-452f-a12b-e6f459431095-40\nfc_ed8e0367-ae10-9fde-9ce6-5d4035a04749_1","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md","offset":50,"limit":40},"result":{"success":{"content":"| 编号 | 处理 | 落点 |\n|---|---|---|\n| F-01 | 可推进时钟、定时器统一走 ctx、跨进程时钟文件 | T-003、AC-007、AC-072；AC-019/028/029/047/049/058/064 改用 advance 或 setNow |\n| F-02 | 规格与金标入库，snapshot 自包含，禁止引用 `.collab` | T-004、AC-073；AC-015/016/017/051 改为读 `contracts/golden` |\n| F-03 | 新增 real-smoke 基线，smoke 步骤带 ac 映射，引入豁免文件；AC-038 归 T-029；AC-027 自建垫片 | AC-038、AC-069、AC-070、AC-027 |\n| F-04 | 只冻结 0.1 副本；保留面与语义变更面分开 | T-002、AC-005 |\n| F-05 | M1 改名；缺陷账本加归属里程碑；新增 milestone-gate | T-001、T-002、AC-074 |\n| F-06 | 单一 AC 索引加属主分片；只在完整运行做发现校验；T-030 依赖补齐 | AC-001、AC-004、T-030 |\n| F-07 | session 和 ui 外壳列为例外；csrf 随会话签发；判定顺序固定 | T-024、AC-059、AC-060 |\n| F-08 | 每个码有唯一 `trigger_id`，新增 `E_LOOPBACK_ONLY` | T-004、AC-009、AC-059 |\n| F-09 | 已确认，保持不变 | 第 2 节 |\n\n## 2. 现状勘误（沿用上一轮，未改）\n\n1. `lib/config.mjs:19` 的 TypeError 来自抛错模板字面量里对 `raw.schema` 的插值。第 19～21 行的 throw 都没有设 `error.code`。\n2. `.gitignore` 只有 3 条字面规则。本轮改为 `config/*.local.json`、`state/`、`*.jsonl`、`.collab/`。\n3. `run --lease`、`cli resolve`、包装调用都是新功能，不按回归处理。\n4. `config/cliworker.local.json` 没有被 git 跟踪，不删除；加载时返回 `E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE`。\n5. `select.mjs` 有三个 forecast 调用点，其中一个在排序比较器里；改为按模型记忆化。\n\n## 3. 可注入缝与时钟（T-003，M1）\n\n**`lib/context.mjs` 的 `createContext(overrides)` 提供：**\n- `exec`、`fs`、`fetch`、`env`、`platform`、`stdout`、`stderr`、`clock`、`random`。\n- `ctx.now()` 只是 `ctx.clock.now()` 的别名。\n\n**真实时钟：**\n- 用 `Date.now` 和全局定时器实现。\n- 如果设置了 `CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE`，`now()` 每次调用都读这个文件（毫秒数或 ISO 时间），定时器仍用真实时间；同时 `main()` 在每个输出里追加 `W_TEST_CLOCK`。\n\n**伪时钟（`test/helpers/clock.mjs`，由 `ctx.mjs` 组合）：**\n- `setNow(t)` 和 `advance(ms)`：按到期时间、相同时按注册顺序触发定时器；`advance` 返回 Promise，每个回调之后等一轮微任务。\n- `sleep(ms)` 登记一个定时器，所以等锁这类循环只有在测试推进时钟时才前进。\n- `pending()` 返回待触发的定时器数量。\n\n**哪些 AC 用哪种时间手段：**\n\n| AC | 手段 |\n|---|---|\n| AC-019、AC-047、AC-049、AC-058 | 同一测试内用 `setNow` 跨过阈值 |","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":312,"fileSize":21902,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md","readRange":{"startLine":50,"endLine":89},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-47886bcf-4a15-452f-a12b-e6f459431095-40\nfc_ed8e0367-ae10-9fde-9ce6-5d4035a04749_1","startedAtMs":"1794076220016","completedAtMs":"1794076220185"},"model_call_id":"1419d7b9-b2c5-497f-97fb-46031fc7648b-14-14mx","session_id":"c184d3d4-8afd-4ca2-8bcf-45797c342546","timestamp_ms":1794076220339}
